    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_sister_01",
      "hash64": "09E187BFBA1153F2",
      "text": "¡Ostras, qué pasada de lugar! ¡Me recuerda\\nal Lago Cristalino![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "6CA0DA4B0F44C858",
      "text": "¿Será este el Laboratorio Cero? Su aspecto\\nexterior concuerda con la descripción de Ságita.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_brother_01",
      "hash64": "DDDCA75853B39AAC",
      "text": "¿Hemos llegado a lo más profundo?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_select_01",
      "hash64": "39BCA7ABE351F41E",
      "text": "¡Eso es!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_select_02",
      "hash64": "39BCA6ABE351F26B",
      "text": "¡Todavía no!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "6CA0DD4B0F44CD71",
      "text": "Sí y no.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "6CA0DC4B0F44CBBE",
      "text": "Este es el lugar más profundo al que llegó\\nla Brigada de Exploración Cero en su día.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "6CA0DF4B0F44D0D7",
      "text": "Y, por lo que tengo entendido, en el sótano del\\nLaboratorio Cero existe una misteriosa sala cuyas\\r\\nfunciones desconozco.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "6CA0DE4B0F44CF24",
      "text": "Pero el lugar al que quiero llegar yo se encuentra\\nincluso más abajo...[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_sister_02",
      "hash64": "09E186BFBA11523F",
      "text": "No entiendo nada... A ver, entonces, si eso es el\\nLaboratorio Cero... ¿tenemos que entrar?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_brother_02",
      "hash64": "DDDCAA5853B39FC5",
      "text": "La puerta está cerrada.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_sister_03",
      "hash64": "09E185BFBA11508C",
      "text": "Anda, es verdad.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_sister_04",
      "hash64": "09E184BFBA114ED9",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]¿Tienes alguna idea, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]? Tú ya\\nhas estado\\r\\naquí, ¿qué hacemos ahora?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
