    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_select_03",
      "hash64": "39BCA5ABE351F0B8",
      "text": "¡Utilizar el panel!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_select_04",
      "hash64": "39BCACABE351FC9D",
      "text": "¡Desactivar el mecanismo de cierre!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_brother_03",
      "hash64": "DDDCA95853B39E12",
      "text": "Ofú, como en las pelis de espías... Qué guay...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_brother_04",
      "hash64": "DDDCA45853B39593",
      "text": "No he dicho nada.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "6CA0E14B0F44D43D",
      "text": "Entonces, ¿podrías abrirnos la puerta?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_sister_05",
      "hash64": "09E183BFBA114D26",
      "text": "Más que \"Laboratorio Cero\", debería llamarse\\n\"Laboratorio Cristalino\".[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_brother_05",
      "hash64": "DDDCA35853B393E0",
      "text": "Usar el panel para desactivar el mecanismo\\nde cierre... Suena tan guay...\\c\\n¿Qué? ¡N-no he dicho nada![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
